C.3 Structural–Robotic (S–R) Consolidation Fault Tree

Top Event: Loss of both structural monitoring and robotic manipulation capability

Fault tree structure:

```
Top Event: S–R Simultaneous Loss
    |
    +--- OR ---+
    |          |
[Common-    [Independent
 Cause       Failures]
